      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    trade_prices = [41.50, 41.75]\n    prevailing_bids = [41.45, 41.73]\n    prevailing_offers = [41.50, 41.75]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    effective_spreads = []\n\n    for trade_price, bid, offer in zip(\n        trade_prices, prevailing_bids, prevailing_offers\n    ):\n        midpoint = (bid + offer) / 2\n        effective_spread = 2 * abs(trade_price - midpoint)\n        effective_spreads.append(effective_spread)\n\n    average_effective_spread = sum(effective_spreads) / len(effective_spreads)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(average_effective_spread, 3)\n```",
